<title>JAPAN: Tokyo corn futures market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo corn futures market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo corn futures market is closed on Thursday for a national holiday and will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, prices ranged from 300 yen to 780 yen per tonne higher. Benchmark September was up 300 yen at 15,300 yen.</p>
</text>
